, a burning tower, a collapsed bridge, an oil rig and an erupting volcano.\n\nA REAL CREW\nThe pilot briefs you on the way in and the hoist operator talks you down on the intercom: ten metres, three metres, feet down.\n\nEARN THREE STARS\nFaster rescues earn more stars. Fly any mission again from the menu to beat your best time.\n\nSingle player. No account, no internet, no in-app purchases.", "short_description": "Ride the hoist cable out of a rescue helicopter and bring people home. Clip on in the cabin door, winch yourself down to a stranded climber, a family on a flooded roof or sailors on a capsized yacht, strap them on and reel back up - ten real hoist rescues from the Alps to an erupting volcano."}]}, "developer_name": "Citiview Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/rescuesimulator/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/rescuesimulator/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1374741209055748"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "13747698390